ADDITIONAL NOTICES AND ACKNOWLEDGMENTS

This project incorporates concepts and techniques from various open-source 
projects and research works. The following acknowledgments are made in 
recognition of their contributions to the field:

- Rust Programming Language: Memory safety principles and zero-cost abstractions
- Bootloader Crate (v0.11.x): BIOS/UEFI boot compatibility and memory mapping
- x86_64 Crate: Hardware abstraction for x86_64 architecture features
- QEMU Project: Virtualization platform used for development and testing
- seL4 Microkernel: Formal verification approaches and security principles
- Redox OS: Rust-first operating system design patterns
- Linux Kernel: Device driver interfaces and hardware compatibility models
- Xen Hypervisor: Virtualization and VFIO passthrough concepts

